msgstr "Greška 404 nakon SSO prijave"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Ako nakon klika na \"Sign in with SSO\" pregledač vrati grešku 404, proverite da li vrednost JWT SSO URI u administratorskim podešavanjima / auth / JWT pokazuje na vaš endpoint i da li je vaš endpoint pokrenut i dostupan."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "Greška dešifrovanja JWT: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Ako nakon preusmeravanja iz vaše aplikacije u Metabase vidite \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", došlo je do problema pri dešifrovanju potpisanog JWT-a. Proverite da METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET ima ispravnu vrednost."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Greška nepoklapanja Tenant ID-ja"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Ako nakon preusmeravanja iz vaše aplikacije u Metabase vidite poruku greške \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", vaša aplikacija pokušava da prijavi korisnika sa pogrešnim tenant slug-om. Pregledajte claim @tenant u JWT-u i uverite se da se poklapa sa tenant-om kojem ovaj tenant korisnik pripada."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Provisioning korisnika je onemogućen za JWT SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Ako nakon preusmeravanja iz vaše aplikacije u Metabase vidite poruku greške \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication.\", provisioning korisnika je isključen za JWT SSO u admin settings/authentication. Ili uključite ovu funkciju da bi se korisnici provisionovali ako još ne postoje, ili obezbedite da korisnici postoje pre nego što ih prijavite preko JWT SSO."

