msgid "Embedding Metabase"
msgstr "Ugradnja Metabase-a"

#: frontend/src/metabase/home/components/EmbedHomepage/EmbedHomepageView.tsx
msgid "Give your customers secure, multi-tenant access to their data with as much (or as little) interactivity and tools to explore data as you want, with as much customization as you need. Embed dashboards, charts—even Metabase's query editor—with iframes or as individual React components."
msgstr "Omogućite svojim korisnicima bezbedan, multi-tenant pristup njihovim podacima, sa onoliko (ili malo) interaktivnosti i alata za istraživanje podataka koliko želite, i uz onoliko prilagođavanja koliko vam treba. Ugradite kontrolne table, grafikone — čak i Metabase-ov kreator upita — preko iframe-ova ili kao pojedinačne React komponente."

#: frontend/src/metabase/home/components/EmbedHomepage/EmbedJsContent.tsx
msgid "Go to setup guide"
msgstr "Idi na vodič za podešavanje"

#: frontend/src/metabase/home/components/EmbedHomepage/EmbedJsContent.tsx
msgid "Activate license"
msgstr "Aktiviraj licencu"

#: frontend/src/metabase/home/components/EmbedHomepage/EmbedJsContent.tsx
msgid "Modular embedding"
msgstr "Modularno ugrađivanje"

#: frontend/src/metabase/home/components/EmbedHomepage/EmbedJsContent.tsx
msgid "A JavaScript library built on top of Metabase’s modular embedding SDK that lets you embed individual components (charts, dashboards, query builder) using plain JS — no React setup required. You get per-component controls like drill-through, parameters, downloads, theming."
msgstr "JavaScript biblioteka izgrađena na Metabase modularnom embedding SDK-u koja vam omogućava da ugradite pojedinačne komponente (grafikone, kontrolne table, kreator upita) koristeći običan JS — bez podešavanja React-a. Dobijate kontrole po komponenti kao što su produbljivanje, parametri, preuzimanja, teme."

