#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Found an integer-indexed aggregation reference but this stage has no `aggregation:` clause"
msgstr "Pronađena je integer-indexed referenca na agregaciju, ali ova faza nema klauzulu `aggregation:`"

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Detected a post-aggregation filter alongside `order-by:`, `limit:`, or `fields:` in the same stage. MBQL 5 requires the filter in a separate stage, but those trailing clauses cannot be safely relocated — they may reference pre-aggregation columns that don''t survive the split. Please author this as two stages explicitly: stage 0 with `source-table`, `aggregation`, `breakout`, and any pre-aggregation `filters`; stage 1 with the post-aggregation `filters`, plus `order-by` / `limit` / `fields` that reference the aggregation''s output via cross-stage `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]` refs."
msgstr "Otkriven je post-agregacioni filter zajedno sa `order-by:`, `limit:`, ili `fields:` u istoj fazi. MBQL 5 zahteva da filter bude u zasebnoj fazi, ali te završne klauzule ne mogu bezbedno da se premeste — mogu da referenciraju pre-agregacione kolone koje ne opstaju nakon razdvajanja. Napišite ovo eksplicitno kao dve faze: faza 0 sa `source-table`, `aggregation`, `breakout` i svim pre-agregacionim `filters`; faza 1 sa post-agregacionim `filters`, plus `order-by` / `limit` / `fields` koji referenciraju izlaz agregacije preko međufaznih `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]` referenci."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Detected a post-aggregation filter (a filter referencing an aggregation from the same stage). MBQL 5 requires this in a separate stage. Auto-fix is unsafe here — either an aggregation''s output column name cannot be derived (e.g. a `metric` reference or unknown head), or two aggregations in this stage would produce the same column name (e.g. two `sum` aggregations on different fields, which lib disambiguates as `sum` / `sum_2` based on field order). Please refactor to multi-stage manually: put the aggregations in stage 0, and the filter in stage 1 referencing the column via a cross-stage `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]` clause. Use an explicit aggregation with a `name` opts override (e.g. `[\"sum\", (opts with key \"name\" → \"sum_total\"), …]`) if you need stable cross-stage names."
msgstr "Otkriven je post-agregacioni filter (filter koji referencira agregaciju iz iste faze). MBQL 5 zahteva da ovo bude u zasebnoj fazi. Auto-popravka ovde nije bezbedna — ili naziv izlazne kolone agregacije ne može da se izvede (npr. `metric` referenca ili nepoznata glava), ili bi dve agregacije u ovoj fazi proizvele isti naziv kolone (npr. dve `sum` agregacije nad različitim poljima, koje biblioteka razdvaja kao `sum` / `sum_2` na osnovu redosleda polja). Refaktorišite ručno u više faza: stavite agregacije u fazu 0, a filter u fazu 1, tako da referencira kolonu preko međufazne klauzule `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]`. Koristite eksplicitnu agregaciju sa `name` opts override (npr. `[\"sum\", (opts sa ključem \"name\" → \"sum_total\"), …]`) ako su vam potrebna stabilna međufazna imena."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} is on table {1}, which has no foreign key from the source table {2}, so it cannot be reached implicitly. To group or filter by a column from that table, add an explicit `joins:` entry and reference the field using the join alias. If you are aggregating a metric that relates to that table (metrics can join tables that have no foreign key), read that metric dimensions resource `metabase://metric/<metric_id>/dimensions` which lists the exact join clause to paste into `joins:` and the columns it unlocks. Otherwise use a field from the source table."
msgstr "Polje {0} je u tabeli {1}, koja nema strani ključ iz izvorne tabele {2}, pa joj se ne može implicitno pristupiti. Da biste grupisali ili filtrirali po koloni iz te tabele, dodajte eksplicitan unos `joins:` i referencirajte polje koristeći alias joina. Ako agregirate metriku koja se odnosi na tu tabelu (metrike mogu da spajaju tabele koje nemaju strani ključ), pročitajte resurs dimenzija metrike `metabase://metric/<metric_id>/dimensions` koji navodi tačnu join klauzulu koju treba nalepiti u `joins:` i kolone koje otključava. U suprotnom koristite polje iz izvorne tabele."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} can be reached from {1} via {2} foreign keys. Specify the `source-field` option on the field clause to disambiguate; call `read_resource` with `metabase://table/<numeric id>/fields` for the source table to list the available foreign-key columns."
msgstr "Polje {0} se može dohvatiti iz {1} preko {2} stranih ključeva. Navedite opciju `source-field` u klauzuli polja da biste razrešili nejednoznačnost; pozovite `read_resource` sa `metabase://table/<numeric id>/fields` za izvornu tabelu da biste izlistali dostupne kolone stranih ključeva."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} is reachable from {1} explicit joins via aliases {2}. Specify the `source-field-join-alias` option on the field clause to pick which join''s foreign key to use."
msgstr "Polje {0} je dostupno iz {1} eksplicitnih join-ova preko aliasa {2}. Navedi opciju `source-field-join-alias` na field klauzuli da izabereš strani ključ kog join-a da se koristi."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "No column named {0} is available to reference in this stage. Reference a column by its machine name (e.g. an aggregation is `max`, `count`, `sum` - never its display label like `Max of X`), not a UI label. Available column names: {1}."
msgstr "Nijedna kolona sa imenom {0} nije dostupna za referenciranje u ovoj fazi. Referencirajte kolonu po njenom mašinskom imenu (npr. agregacija je `max`, `count`, `sum` — nikad po njenoj prikaznoj oznaci kao `Max of X`), a ne po UI oznaci. Dostupna imena kolona: {1}."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Stage {0} aggregation entry {1} is a `field` clause, not an aggregation. The `aggregation:` block expects aggregation functions like `count`, `sum`, `avg`, `metric`, etc. - or wrap the field in one (e.g. `[sum, <opts>, <field>]`). If you wanted to group by this column, use `breakout:` instead."
msgstr "Faza {0} ima aggregation unos {1} koji je klauzula `field`, a ne agregacija. Blok `aggregation:` očekuje agregacione funkcije poput `count`, `sum`, `avg`, `metric`, itd. — ili umotaj polje u neku od njih (npr. `[sum, <opts>, <field>]`). Ako si hteo/la da grupišeš po ovoj koloni, koristi `breakout:` umesto toga."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`case` (and `if`) uses its third positional argument as the fallback value, not a `default` key in the options map. Move the value out of the options map and append it as the third arg of the clause: `[case, <opts>, <branch-pairs>, <default>]`. Omit the third arg entirely if you have no fallback (the result will be null on miss)."
msgstr "`case` (i `if`) koristi svoj treći pozicioni argument kao fallback vrednost, a ne ključ `default` u options mapi. Premesti vrednost iz options mape i dodaj je kao treći arg klauzule: `[case, <opts>, <branch-pairs>, <default>]`. Izostavi treći arg u potpunosti ako nemaš fallback (rezultat će biti null kada nema pogodaka)."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`{0}` is not a clause in repr; it was a top-level operation in the older sexp pipeline. {1}"
msgstr "`{0}` nije klauzula u repr; to je bila top-level operacija u starijem sexp pipeline-u. {1}"

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`[expression, <opts>, <name>]` reference requires a non-blank string identifier in the third slot, matching an entry in some stage''s `expressions:` block."
msgstr "Referenca `[expression, <opts>, <name>]` zahteva neprazan string identifikator u trećem slotu, koji odgovara unosu u nekom stage-ovom `expressions:` bloku."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`field` clause needs a portable FK in its third slot, not a numeric id. Use a vector `[<database>, <schema>, <table>, <column>]` (resolved against the metadata provider) or a string column-name (for cross-stage references)."
msgstr "Klauzuli `field` je potreban prenosivi FK u trećem slotu, a ne numerički id. Koristi vektor `[<database>, <schema>, <table>, <column>]` (razrešen preko metadata provider-a) ili string column-name (za cross-stage reference)."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
