msgid "The vLLM server at {0} did not respond within {1}ms. Check that it is running and not overloaded."
msgstr "vLLM server na {0} nije odgovorio u roku od {1}ms. Proverite da radi i da nije preopterećen."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "Check that {0} is a vLLM server''s OpenAI-compatible API — the base URL should end in /v1."
msgstr "Proverite da je {0} OpenAI-kompatibilni API vLLM servera — base URL treba da se završava sa /v1."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} is served with a {1} token context window, which is too small for Metabot — it needs at least {2}. Restart vLLM with a larger --max-model-len."
msgstr "{0} se služi sa kontekstnim prozorom od {1} tokena, što je premalo za Metabot — potrebno mu je najmanje {2}. Ponovo pokrenite vLLM sa većim --max-model-len."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} streamed its reasoning as chat text. Restart vLLM with --reasoning-parser so thinking doesn''t appear inside Metabot''s answers."
msgstr "{0} je strimovao svoje rezonovanje kao chat tekst. Ponovo pokrenite vLLM sa --reasoning-parser da se razmišljanje ne pojavljuje unutar Metabot odgovora."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} reached the {1} token connection-test ceiling partway through a tool call. A model that generates this much before calling a tool is too slow to drive Metabot."
msgstr "{0} je dostigao plafon connection-test-a od {1} tokena usred poziva alata. Model koji generiše ovoliko pre poziva alata je previše spor da pokreće Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server returned a tool call whose arguments are not valid JSON. The --tool-call-parser most likely does not match {0}''s output format."
msgstr "vLLM server je vratio poziv alata čiji argumenti nisu važeći JSON. Najverovatnije se --tool-call-parser ne poklapa sa formatom izlaza za {0}."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} spent the entire {1} token connection-test budget reasoning without calling a tool. A model that thinks this long about a trivial prompt is too slow to drive Metabot."
msgstr "{0} je potrošio ceo budžet connection-test-a od {1} tokena na rezonovanje bez poziva alata. Model koji ovako dugo razmišlja o trivijalnom promptu je previše spor da pokreće Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} reached the {1} token connection-test ceiling before completing a tool call. A model that generates this much before calling a tool is too slow to drive Metabot."
msgstr "{0} je dostigao plafon connection-test-a od {1} tokena pre nego što je završio poziv alata. Model koji generiše ovoliko pre poziva alata je previše spor da pokreće Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server answered with text instead of calling a tool. Restart it with --enable-auto-tool-choice and a --tool-call-parser matching {0}''s output format."
msgstr "vLLM server je odgovorio tekstom umesto da pozove alat. Ponovo ga pokrenite sa --enable-auto-tool-choice i --tool-call-parser koji odgovara formatu izlaza za {0}."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "{0} reached the {1} token connection-test ceiling without producing a forced tool call. Metabot needs structured output support for conversation titles and SQL generation."
msgstr "{0} je dostigao plafon connection-test-a od {1} tokena bez generisanja prisilnog poziva alata. Metabot-u je potrebna podrška za strukturisani izlaz za naslove razgovora i generisanje SQL-a."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server did not honor a forced tool call. Metabot needs structured output support for conversation titles and SQL generation."
msgstr "vLLM server nije ispoštovao prisilni poziv alata. Metabot-u je potrebna podrška za strukturisani izlaz za naslove razgovora i generisanje SQL-a."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server is reachable but is not serving any models."
msgstr "vLLM server je dostupan, ali ne opslužuje nijedan model."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server is not serving {0}. It is serving: {1}."
msgstr "vLLM server ne opslužuje {0}. Opslužuje: {1}."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server did not answer the connection test within {0}ms. Check that it is not overloaded — a server this slow to answer a trivial prompt cannot drive Metabot."
msgstr "vLLM server nije odgovorio na test povezivanja u roku od {0}ms. Proverite da nije preopterećen — server koji ovako sporo odgovara na trivijalan prompt ne može da pokreće Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server stopped responding after {0}ms. Raise the vLLM request timeout, or serve a faster model."
msgstr "vLLM server je prestao da odgovara posle {0}ms. Povećajte timeout za vLLM zahteve ili opslužujte brži model."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The connection to the vLLM server was interrupted before the response finished."
msgstr "Veza sa vLLM serverom je prekinuta pre nego što je odgovor završen."

#: metabase/metabot/self/vllm.clj
msgid "The vLLM server did not respond within {0}ms. Check that it is not overloaded, or raise the vLLM request timeout."
msgstr "vLLM server nije odgovorio u roku od {0}ms. Proverite da nije preopterećen ili povećajte timeout za vLLM zahteve."

