msgstr "Z.AI API endpoint nije pronađen — proverite osnovni URL"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI has rate limited us"
msgstr "Z.AI nas je ograničio po stopi"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI returned an internal server error"
msgstr "Z.AI je vratio internu serversku grešku"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI API error (HTTP {0})"
msgstr "Greška Z.AI API-ja (HTTP {0})"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Override Metabot ID for agent streaming requests."
msgstr "Zameni Metabot ID za streaming zahteve agenta."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether Metabot is enabled for regular usage."
msgstr "Da li je Metabot omogućen za redovno korišćenje."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The display name for Metabot, shown throughout the Metabase UI."
msgstr "Prikazno ime za Metabot, prikazano kroz Metabase UI."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The icon for Metabot. Set to `metabot` for the default icon, or a data URI for a custom uploaded image (up to 1MB)."
msgstr "Ikonica za Metabot. Postavite na `metabot` za podrazumevanu ikonicu ili data URI za prilagođenu otpremljenu sliku (do 1MB)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether to show Metabot illustrations in the UI."
msgstr "Da li da se prikazuju Metabot ilustracije u UI-ju."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the chat experience (the AI sidebar and embedded Metabot)."
msgstr "Prilagođena uputstva priložena Metabot''s sistemskom promptu za iskustvo četa (VI bočna traka i ugrađeni Metabot)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the natural language query (AI exploration) experience."
msgstr "Prilagođena uputstva priložena Metabot''s sistemskom promptu za iskustvo upita prirodnim jezikom (VI istraživanje)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the SQL generation experience."
msgstr "Prilagođena uputstva priložena Metabot''s sistemskom promptu za iskustvo generisanja SQL-a."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether Metabot is enabled for embedding."
msgstr "Da li je Metabot omogućen za ugradnju."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether the user''s recently viewed items are included in the Metabot system prompt."
msgstr "Da li su korisnikove nedavno pregledane stavke uključene u Metabot sistemski prompt."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Invalid Azure model {0}. Expected format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> where <family> is one of: {1}"
msgstr "Nevažeći Azure model {0}. Očekivani format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> gde je <family> jedno od: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Unsupported model {0} for Metabase managed AI. Supported models: {1}"
msgstr "Nepodržan model {0} za Metabase managed AI. Podržani modeli: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Metabot provider must be a string, got: {0}"
msgstr "Metabot provajder mora biti string, dobijeno: {0}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Model name is required. Expected format: connection/model, e.g. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""
msgstr "Naziv modela je obavezan. Očekivani format: konekcija/model, npr. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Konekcija AI provajdera i model za Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, npr. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. Ključ konekcije imenuje unos u podešavanju `llm-providers` i podrazumevano je tip provajdera."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "Konekcija AI provajdera i model za brze pozadinske zadatke, kao što je imenovanje Metabot razgovora, u istom formatu connection-key/model-name kao `llm-metabot-provider`. Podrazumevano se koristi najbrži model koji nudi konekcija na kojoj Metabot radi."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Number of days to retain rows in the ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, and metabot_message tables. Minimum value is 30; set to 0 to retain data indefinitely."
msgstr "Broj dana za zadržavanje redova u tabelama ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation i metabot_message. Minimalna vrednost je 30; postavi na 0 da bi se podaci zadržavali neograničeno."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "`source-table:` does not accept URIs like `{0}`. {1}"
msgstr "`source-table:` ne prihvata URI-jeve kao `{0}`. {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Unknown database: `{0}`. Use the exact database name as reported by search / `read_resource` (it appears as the first element of every portable FK, e.g. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."
msgstr "Nepoznata baza podataka: `{0}`. Koristi tačan naziv baze podataka kako ga prijavljuje pretraga / `read_resource` (pojavljuje se kao prvi element svakog prenosivog FK, npr. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Multiple databases share the name `{0}` (ids: {1}). The agent has no way to disambiguate; ask the user to rename one of the databases or use a more specific identifier."
msgstr "Više baza podataka deli naziv `{0}` (id-jevi: {1}). Agent nema način da razreši dvosmislenost; zatraži od korisnika da preimenuje jednu od baza podataka ili da koristi specifičniji identifikator."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
#: metabase/models/serialization/resolve/mp.clj
msgid "No saved question or model found with entity_id {0}. Do not invent or guess entity_ids: call `read_resource` with `metabase://question/<numeric id>` or `metabase://model/<numeric id>` first, then copy the exact `portable_entity_id` from the response into `source-card:`."
msgstr "Nije pronađeno sačuvano pitanje niti model sa entity_id {0}. Nemoj izmišljati niti pogađati entity_ids: prvo pozovi `read_resource` sa `metabase://question/<numeric id>` ili `metabase://model/<numeric id>`, pa zatim kopiraj tačan `portable_entity_id` iz odgovora u `source-card:`."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "First stage must have either `source-table:` (as a portable FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`) or `source-card:` (as an entity_id string). Neither was found in `stages[0]`."
msgstr "Prva faza mora imati ili `source-table:` (kao prenosivi FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`) ili `source-card:` (kao entity_id string). Ni jedno ni drugo nije pronađeno u `stages[0]`."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "The constructed query is not runnable - it would fail the query builder''s validation, so it cannot be visualized or saved. This usually means a field reference is missing its type or names a column that does not exist, or an aggregation/window function (e.g. `offset`) was placed in `expressions:` (custom columns) where it is not allowed - move it to `aggregation:` or `order-by:`. Schema validation details: {0}"
msgstr "Sastavljeni upit ne može da se pokrene — pao bi validaciju kreatora upita, pa ne može da se vizualizuje ili sačuva. Ovo obično znači da referenci na polje nedostaje tip ili da navodi kolonu koja ne postoji, ili da je agregaciona/prozorska funkcija (npr. `offset`) stavljena u `expressions:` (prilagođene kolone) gde nije dozvoljena — premestite je u `aggregation:` ili `order-by:`. Detalji validacije šeme: {0}"

