msgstr "Vremenska oznaka poslednje uspešne sinhronizacije preporuka Security Center-a."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "The registered embedding provider to use"
msgstr "Registrovani embedding provajder koji će se koristiti"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Set the embedding model for the selected provider"
msgstr "Podesi embedding model za izabranog provajdera"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Prefix prepended to search queries (but not indexed documents) before embedding them, as expected by asymmetric retrieval models such as the snowflake-arctic-embed family. It is prepended verbatim, so include any trailing separator. Leave empty to use the default for the model, which varies by generation: Arctic Embed v2.0 expects `query: `, earlier versions expect a longer instruction."
msgstr "Prefiks koji se dodaje na početak upita za pretragu (ali ne i indeksiranih dokumenata) pre njihovog embedding-a, kako očekuju modeli za asimetrično preuzimanje kao što je snowflake-arctic-embed familija. Dodaje se doslovno, pa uključite i eventualni završni separator. Ostavite prazno da biste koristili podrazumevanu vrednost za model, koja varira po generaciji: Arctic Embed v2.0 očekuje `query: `, ranije verzije očekuju dužu instrukciju."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Set the dimension size for the selected embedding model"
msgstr "Podesi veličinu dimenzije za izabrani embedding model"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "URL of the OpenAI-compatible embedding service (e.g. a LiteLLM proxy)."
msgstr "URL OpenAI-kompatibilnog embedding servisa (npr. LiteLLM proxy)."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "API key for authenticating with the embedding service. Leave empty for proxying thorugh ai-service. In that case premium-embedding-token is used for authentication."
msgstr "API ključ za autentifikaciju sa embedding servisom. Ostavite prazno za prosleđivanje kroz ai-service. U tom slučaju se za autentifikaciju koristi premium-embedding-token."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Wrap embedding-service calls in a circuit breaker that fails fast after repeated failures. Runtime kill switch; the breaker thresholds are fixed."
msgstr "Obmotaj pozive embedding servisa circuit breaker-om koji brzo otkazuje posle ponovljenih neuspeha. Runtime kill switch; pragovi breaker-a su fiksni."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "The maximum number of tokens sent in a single embedding API call."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj tokena poslatih u jednom embedding API pozivu."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Maximum number of results to return from a single semantic search query."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj rezultata iz jednog upita semantičke pretrage."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default vector-search strategy for semantic search: `hnsw` (approximate, HNSW-index-backed), `brute-force` (exact, applies non-vector filters first then computes cosine distance over the survivors), or `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (HNSW-index-backed iterative scans with inline filters). Defaults to `brute-force`, which needs no index; selecting `hnsw` builds the HNSW index just-in-time. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_strategy` API parameter."
msgstr "Podrazumevana strategija vektorske pretrage za semantičku pretragu: `hnsw` (aproksimativna, zasnovana na HNSW indeksu), `brute-force` (tačna, prvo primenjuje ne-vektorske filtere pa zatim računa kosinusnu udaljenost nad preživelima), ili `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (iterativna skeniranja zasnovana na HNSW indeksu sa inline filterima). Podrazumevano je `brute-force`, kojem ne treba indeks; izbor `hnsw` gradi HNSW indeks just-in-time. Pojedinačni HTTP zahtevi mogu ovo da pregaze preko API parametra `vector_search_strategy`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (HNSW candidate-list size) for the `hnsw-iterative-*` strategies. Larger values improve recall at the cost of latency. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_ef_search` API parameter."
msgstr "Podrazumevani pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (veličina HNSW liste kandidata) za strategije `hnsw-iterative-*`. Veće vrednosti poboljšavaju recall, uz cenu latencije. Pojedinačni HTTP zahtevi mogu ovo da pregaze preko API parametra `vector_search_ef_search`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default pgvector `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` (soft cap on tuples an iterative scan visits) for the `hnsw-iterative-*` strategies. Larger values improve recall under selective filters at the cost of latency. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_max_scan_tuples` API parameter."
msgstr "Podrazumevani pgvector `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` (soft cap na torke koje iterativno skeniranje obilazi) za strategije `hnsw-iterative-*`. Veće vrednosti poboljšavaju recall pod selektivnim filterima, uz cenu latencije. Pojedinačni HTTP zahtevi mogu ovo da pregaze preko API parametra `vector_search_max_scan_tuples`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Run EXPLAIN (ANALYZE) instrumentation of the inner vector subquery for every semantic search? Expensive (re-executes the inner query); intended for ad-hoc analysis. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_explain` API parameter."
msgstr "Pokreni EXPLAIN (ANALYZE) instrumentaciju unutrašnjeg vektorskog podupita za svaku semantičku pretragu? Skupo (ponovo izvršava unutrašnji upit); namenjeno ad-hoc analizi. Pojedinačni HTTP zahtevi mogu ovo da pregaze preko API parametra `vector_search_explain`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Minimum number of semantic search results required before falling back to other engines."
msgstr "Minimalan broj rezultata semantičke pretrage pre nego što se pređe na druge pretraživače."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of threads to use for batched index updates, including embedding requests"
msgstr "Broj niti za batch ažuriranja indeksa, uključujući embedding zahteve"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours to retain stale semantic search indexes before cleanup."
msgstr "Broj sati zadržavanja zastarelih indeksa semantičke pretrage pre čišćenja."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours to retain tombstone records in the gate table before cleanup."
msgstr "Broj sati zadržavanja tombstone zapisa u gate tabeli pre čišćenja."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours until repair tables are considered stale and eligible for cleanup, if they were not\n"
"    cleaned up successfully after use."
msgstr "Broj sati nakon kojih se repair tabele smatraju zastarelim i podobnim za čišćenje, ako nisu\n"
"    uspešno očišćene nakon upotrebe."

